2. Employee APIs
-----------------------------------------------
Save Employee
--------------------
POST

http://localhost:8080/employee/save

Body

{
    "employeeName":"Amit",
    "department":"IT",
    "salary":50000
}
Get All Employees
------------------
GET
http://localhost:8080/employee/all

Get Employee By ID
-------------------
GET
http://localhost:8080/employee/1

Update Employee
-------------------
PUT
http://localhost:8080/employee/update/1
Body

{
    "employeeName":"Rahul",
    "department":"HR",
    "salary":65000
}
Delete Employee
------------------
DELETE
http://localhost:8080/employee/delete/1


